#
# An undetermined outcome treated as an ordinary failure AND RETRIED — the move the
# no-blind-retry discipline exists to forbid, and the one no fixture reached until
# the kernel carried a retry record to forbid it ON.
#
# Every record here is individually well-formed. The unknown outcome names its
# attempt. The retry names the attempt it re-sends AND names a licence, so the
# presence law (logic:RetryRequiresLicenceConstraint) passes. The idempotency
# contract binds all five of its fields, so its completeness law passes too. What is
# wrong is a RELATION: the licence covers ex:invoice902Charge, and the retry re-sends
# ex:invoice901Charge.
#
# What it costs in the world: the first charge's outcome was never established — the
# provider timed out mid-commit — and the retry proceeds under the idempotency
# contract issued for the NEXT invoice, whose key differs. The provider sees a fresh
# key, and the customer is charged twice. A licence borrowed from a neighbouring
# dispatch reads identically to a real one, which is why counting the licence was
# never enough.
#
# It is the substitution case, not the absence case: the absence sibling
# (unknown-outcome-without-attempt.ttl) reaches only
# logic:UnknownOutcomeNamesItsAttemptConstraint and contains no retry at all.
#
# MUST trip logic:NoBlindRetryConstraint.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/tests/> .

ex:invoice901Charge a logic:EffectAttempt ;
    rdfs:label "the charge whose outcome the provider never confirmed"@en .

ex:invoice901Unknown a logic:ExternalOutcomeUnknown ;
    rdfs:label "an undetermined outcome, recorded honestly and then read as a failure"@en ;
    logic:unknownOfAttempt ex:invoice901Charge .

ex:invoice901Retry a logic:RetryDispatch ;
    rdfs:label "a re-send of the undetermined charge, under someone else's licence"@en ;
    logic:retryOfAttempt ex:invoice901Charge ;
    logic:retryLicence ex:invoice902Idempotency .

# The licence: complete, valid, and about a DIFFERENT attempt.
ex:invoice902Idempotency a logic:IdempotencyContract ;
    rdfs:label "the idempotency contract discharged for the following invoice"@en ;
    logic:idempotencyScope ex:acmePayments ;
    logic:idempotencyKey "invoice:902:charge" ;
    logic:idempotencyRetention "PT24H" ;
    logic:idempotencyDuplicateSemantics ex:collapseWithinWindow ;
    logic:idempotencyProviderEvidence ex:acmeIdempotencySpec ;
    logic:licenceCoversAttempt ex:invoice902Charge .

ex:invoice902Charge a logic:EffectAttempt ;
    rdfs:label "the charge the licence actually covers"@en .
